   "role": "user",
   "content": "CLAIM C1 (comparison, section \"Abstract\"):\n\"GatedMix reaches 27.1 BLEU on WMT 2014 English-German, outperforming all previous single models, while training 3x faster than an LSTM baseline.\"\n\n=== ANALYST VERDICT (round 0) ===\n{\n \"reasoning\": \"Two components of the claim are backed by the paper's own reported results: 27.1 BLEU on WMT 2014 En-De (vs 26.4 ConvS2S, 24.6 GNMT) and ~3x faster training than \\\"our LSTM baseline.\\\" However, the sweeping part — \\\"outperforming all previous single models\\\" — is contradicted by related literature: an attention-only single model reports 28.4 BLEU on the same benchmark, explicitly establishing a new state of the art, which beats GatedMix's 27.1. So the number and speed factor hold, but the state-of-the-art/superiority claim does not. Additionally, the 27.1 figure is a self-report (evidence that it was reported, not independent confirmation), and the 3x speedup is measured only against the authors' own LSTM baseline, not against ConvS2S or GNMT.\",\n \"verdict\": \"CONTRADICTED\",\n \"confidence\": 0.78,\n \"evidence\": [\n  {\n   \"chunk_id\": \"arxiv:0000.00000#4\",\n   \"quote\": \"On WMT 2014 English-German, GatedMix obtains 27.1 BLEU, compared with 26.4 for ConvS2S and 24.6 for GNMT.\",\n   \"stance\": \"supports\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"chunk_id\": \"arxiv:0000.00000#4\",\n   \"quote\": \"Training takes 2.1 days on 4 GPUs, about three times faster than our LSTM baseline trained on the same hardware.\",\n   \"stance\": \"supports\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"chunk_id\": \"openalex:W3#0\",\n   \"quote\": \"Our attention-only model obtains 28.4 BLEU on WMT 2014 English-German as a single model, establishing a new state of the art.\",\n   \"stance\": \"contradicts\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"chunk_id\": \"openalex:W2#0\",\n   \"quote\": \"Applied to language modeling and to machine translation, gated token mixers match LSTM quality while training twice as fast.\",\n   \"stance\": \"context\"\n  }\n ],\n \"concerns\": [\n  \"The 'outperforming all previous single models' claim is falsified by a related single model reporting 28.4 BLEU on the same benchmark; the paper compares only against ConvS2S and GNMT.\",\n  \"The 3x speedup is relative to the authors' own in-house LSTM baseline, not to ConvS2S/GNMT, so the comparison is not benchmarked against published systems.\",\n  \"The 27.1 BLEU is a single self-reported number with no mention of seeds, tuning protocol, or variance.\",\n  \"The claim as stated is a self-report in the abstract; the evidence shows the result was reported, not independently reproduced.\"\n ]\n}\n\n=== GROUNDING CHECK (deterministic) ===\n[\n {\n  \"claim_id\": \"C1\",\n  \"chunk_id\": \"arxiv:0000.00000#4\",\n  \"quote\": \"On WMT 2014 English-German, GatedMix obtains 27.1 BLEU, compared with 26.4 for ConvS2S and 24.6 for GNMT.\",\n  \"score\": 100.0,\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"by_role\": \"analyst\",\n  \"round\": 0,\n  \"exists\": true,\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n },\n {\n  \"claim_id\": \"C1\",\n  \"chunk_id\": \"arxiv:0000.00000#4\",\n  \"quote\": \"Training takes 2.1 days on 4 GPUs, about three times faster than our LSTM baseline trained on the same hardware.\",\n  \"score\": 100.0,\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"by_role\": \"analyst\",\n  \"round\": 0,\n  \"exists\": true,\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n },\n {\n  \"claim_id\": \"C1\",\n  \"chunk_id\": \"openalex:W3#0\",\n  \"quote\": \"Our attention-only model obtains 28.4 BLEU on WMT 2014 English-German as a single model, establishing a new state of the art.\",\n  \"score\": 100.0,\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"by_role\": \"analyst\",\n  \"round\": 0,\n  \"exists\": true,\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n },\n {\n  \"claim_id\": \"C1\",\n  \"chunk_id\": \"openalex:W2#0\",\n  \"quote\": \"Applied to language modeling and to machine translation, gated token mixers match LSTM quality while training twice as fast.\",\n  \"score\": 100.0,\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"by_role\": \"analyst\",\n  \"round\": 0,\n  \"exists\": true,\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n }\n]\n\n==